{crmScope extensionKey='org.project60.sepa'}

{htxt id='id-template-help'}
    <p>{ts}Select the template that should be used to create this prenotification file.{/ts}</p>
    <p>{ts}The default template can be found and edited at "Communications" -> "Message Templates" -> "System Workflow Messages"{/ts}</p>
    <p>{ts}The templates listed here are all user templates that begin with the prefix 'SEPA'.{/ts}</p>
{/htxt}
{htxt id='id-change-cycleday-help'}
    <p>{ts}When you change the cycle day be aware that you might end up collecting twice in the same month, or miss a collection altogether.{/ts}</p>
{/htxt}


{htxt id='id-collect-outstanding-help'}
  {ts 1=$params.pending_label 2=$params.on_hold_label}If checked, a OOFF mandate will be created with the sum of the amounts of contributions in status "%1" marked as "%2".{/ts}
{/htxt}

{/crmScope}
